WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.470
- Well, true or false?

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:03.900
I love your beard game, but I did hear

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.550
that when you were on Law and Order,

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.420
- Uh huh.

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:07.590
- you were asked to get rid of it

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:10.080
because Dick Wolf's wife didn't like it.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.480
- That's the word on the street.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.592
My first 10 on law and order,

00:00:15.592 --> 00:00:18.510
back in 2008, 2009, I came with a beard,

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:20.580
not as full as this,
but I came with a beard.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:25.230
We did a full season and then our second,

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:27.600
my second season on the show, got a call

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.280
into Dick Wolf's office.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:32.070
I thought I was in trouble
and they were like, 'Yeah.'

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:33.660
Jeremy Sisto and I both had beards,

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.370
and we thought we were both getting fired

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:37.200
cause we both got called into the office.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.033
- [Kelly] Oh no.

00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:38.866
- And basically it was like,

00:00:38.866 --> 00:00:41.040
you guys need to shave, tomorrow.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.870
And they worked it into the script

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:44.400
and we had to shave our beards.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.300
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.133
- Yeah.

00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:47.580
- She is a powerful woman.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:48.731
- Yeah well, you know what?

00:00:48.731 --> 00:00:49.800
- Yeah. Hey. Hey.
- A powerful, yeah.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.240
- Happy wife, happy life.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:52.073
- Okay.

00:00:52.073 --> 00:00:52.906
- You know?

00:00:52.906 --> 00:00:54.552
